WEBVTT

00:10:27.245 --> 00:10:31.180
Now, because math became
my art, became my reminder,

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:33.510
my guide of what I needed to do,

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:38.144
and what my goal was,
I started loving math.

00:10:39.714 --> 00:10:43.128
Because of this, I was
not only able to keep my job,

00:10:43.128 --> 00:10:45.746
but also make it interesting for others.

00:10:47.076 --> 00:10:52.120
Now ten years down the line, I have
a wonderful job in a great company.

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:58.711
I am able to move my entire family
to Pune to live with me.